<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

<title>비상대응훈련 출결관리 관리자</title>

<script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.12.4/firebase-app-compat.js"></script>
<script src="https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/10.12.4/firebase-firestore-compat.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/xlsx@0.18.5/dist/xlsx.full.min.js"></script>
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/qrcode@1.5.3/build/qrcode.min.js"></script>

<style>
:root {
  --red:#c00000;
  --blue:#2563eb;
  --green:#059669;
  --yellow:#ca8a04;
  --gray-50:#f8fafc;
  --gray-100:#f1f5f9;
  --gray-200:#e2e8f0;
  --gray-300:#cbd5e1;
  --gray-500:#64748b;
  --gray-700:#334155;
  --gray-900:#0f172a;
  --border:#1f2937;
  --table-line:#8a8a8a;
  --shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(15,23,42,.08);
  --radius:20px;
  --row-height:44px;
  --head-height:54px;
}

* {
  box-sizing:border-box;
}

body {
  margin:0;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f8fafc 0%,#fff 45%);
  color:var(--gray-900);
  font-family:"Malgun Gothic","Apple SD Gothic Neo",Arial,sans-serif;
}

.app {
  max-width:1500px;
  margin:0 auto;
  padding:30px 28px 32px;
}

.hero {
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:flex-start;
  gap:20px;
  margin-bottom:22px;
  padding:30px 34px;
  border:1px solid var(--gray-200);
  border-radius:24px;
  background:#fff;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}

.eyebrow {
  margin:0 0 8px;
  color:var(--red);
  font-size:14px;
  font-weight:900;
  letter-spacing:.12em;
}

h1 {
  margin:0;
  font-size:38px;
  font-weight:900;
  letter-spacing:-.04em;
}

.hero-desc {
  margin:12px 0 0;
  color:var(--gray-500);
  font-size:15px;
  line-height:1.6;
}

.clock-card {
  min-width:280px;
  padding:18px 20px;
  border-radius:16px;
  background:var(--gray-900);
  color:#fff;
  text-align:right;
}

.clock-card span {
  display:block;
  margin-bottom:7px;
  color:#cbd5e1;
  font-size:13px;
  font-weight:800;
}

.clock-card strong {
  display:block;
  font-size:21px;
}

.connection-state {
  margin-top:10px;
  font-size:12px;
  font-weight:800;
  color:#cbd5e1;
  line-height:1.4;
}

.connection-state.ok {
  color:#86efac;
}

.connection-state.warn {
  color:#fde68a;
}

.connection-state.error {
  color:#fca5a5;
}

.grid {
  display:grid;
  gap:18px;
  margin-bottom:20px;
}

.grid.two {
  grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(360px,.9fr);
}

.card,
.section {
  border:1px solid var(--gray-200);
  border-radius:var(--radius);
  background:#fff;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
  overflow:hidden;
}

.card-header,
.section-header {
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:center;
  gap:14px;
  padding:20px 22px;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--gray-200);
  background:#fff;
}

.card-body,
.section-body {
  padding:22px;
}

.card-title,
.plain-title {
  margin:0;
  font-size:22px;
  font-weight:900;
  letter-spacing:-.03em;
}

.card-subtitle {
  margin:5px 0 0;
  color:var(--gray-500);
  font-size:13px;
  line-height:1.5;
}

.form-grid {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
  gap:14px;
}

.form-grid .full {
  grid-column:1 / -1;
}

label {
  display:block;
  margin-bottom:7px;
  color:var(--gray-700);
  font-size:13px;
  font-weight:900;
}

input,
select,
textarea {
  width:100%;
  border:1px solid var(--gray-300);
  border-radius:12px;
  background:#fff;
  color:var(--gray-900);
  font-family:inherit;
  outline:none;
}

input,
select {
  height:44px;
  padding:0 13px;
  font-size:15px;
}

textarea {
  min-height:132px;
  padding:14px;
  resize:vertical;
  font-size:14px;
  line-height:1.55;
  font-family:"Malgun Gothic",monospace;
}

input:focus,
select:focus,
textarea:focus {
  border-color:var(--blue);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(37,99,235,.14);
}

button {
  min-height:38px;
  border:1px solid var(--gray-300);
  border-radius:10px;
  padding:8px 14px;
  background:#fff;
  color:var(--gray-900);
  font-family:inherit;
  font-size:14px;
  font-weight:900;
  cursor:pointer;
}

button:hover {
  filter:brightness(.97);
}

button.primary {
  border-color:var(--blue);
  background:var(--blue);
  color:#fff;
}

button.red {
  border-color:var(--red);
  background:var(--red);
  color:#fff;
}

button.green {
  border-color:var(--green);
  background:var(--green);
  color:#fff;
}

button.ghost-red {
  border-color:rgba(192,0,0,.35);
  background:#fff5f5;
  color:var(--red);
}

button:disabled {
  opacity:.45;
  cursor:not-allowed;
}

.button-row {
  display:flex;
  flex-wrap:wrap;
  gap:9px;
  margin-top:16px;
}

.info-line {
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:flex-start;
  gap:12px;
  padding:12px 0;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--gray-200);
}

.info-line:last-child {
  border-bottom:0;
}

.info-label {
  color:var(--gray-500);
  font-size:13px;
  font-weight:900;
  white-space:nowrap;
}

.info-value {
  text-align:right;
  font-size:14px;
  font-weight:800;
  word-break:break-all;
}

.badge {
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  min-width:72px;
  height:30px;
  border-radius:999px;
  padding:0 12px;
  font-size:13px;
  font-weight:900;
}

.badge.wait {
  background:#fff7ed;
  color:#c2410c;
}

.badge.open {
  background:#ecfdf5;
  color:#047857;
}

.badge.closed {
  background:#f1f5f9;
  color:#475569;
}

.badge.empty {
  background:#fef2f2;
  color:var(--red);
}

.summary-grid {
  display:grid;
  grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));
  gap:14px;
  margin-bottom:22px;
}

.summary-card {
  padding:18px 20px;
  border:1px solid var(--gray-200);
  border-radius:18px;
  background:#fff;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}

.summary-card span {
  display:block;
  margin-bottom:6px;
  color:var(--gray-500);
  font-size:13px;
  font-weight:900;
}

.summary-card strong {
  display:block;
  font-size:31px;
  letter-spacing:-.04em;
}

.section {
  margin-top:22px;
}

.red-title {
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  min-height:42px;
  padding:0 22px;
  border-radius:12px;
  background:var(--red);
  color:#fff;
  font-size:20px;
  font-weight:900;
  box-shadow:0 5px 14px rgba(192,0,0,.2);
}

.hint {
  margin:0 0 10px;
  color:var(--gray-500);
  font-size:13px;
  line-height:1.6;
}

.message {
  min-height:22px;
  margin-top:10px;
  color:var(--gray-700);
  font-size:13px;
  font-weight:800;
  line-height:1.5;
}

.message.ok {
  color:var(--green);
}

.message.warn {
  color:var(--yellow);
}

.message.error {
  color:var(--red);
}

.tool-row {
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  align-items:center;
  gap:12px;
  margin:18px 0 12px;
}

.search-box {
  max-width:380px;
}

.table-wrap {
  border:2px solid var(--border);
  background:#fff;
  overflow-y:auto;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}

.table-wrap.members {
  max-height:calc(var(--head-height) + var(--row-height) * 20 + 4px);
}

.table-wrap.attendance {
  max-height:calc(var(--head-height) + var(--row-height) * 25 + 4px);
}

.table-wrap.qr {
  max-height:520px;
}

.table-wrap.dashboard {
  max-height:520px;
}

table {
  width:100%;
  border-collapse:collapse;
  table-layout:fixed;
  font-size:16px;
}

th,
td {
  height:var(--row-height);
  border:1px solid var(--table-line);
  padding:6px 8px;
  text-align:center;
  vertical-align:middle;
  word-break:keep-all;
  overflow-wrap:anywhere;
}

th {
  position:sticky;
  top:0;
  z-index:2;
  height:var(--head-height);
  background:#fff;
  font-size:17px;
  font-weight:900;
}

.empty-row {
  height:86px;
  color:var(--gray-500);
  font-size:15px;
  font-weight:800;
}

.complete {
  color:#111;
  font-weight:900;
}

.checking {
  color:var(--red);
  font-weight:900;
}

.absence {
  color:#c2410c;
  font-weight:900;
}

.qr-canvas {
  width:82px;
  height:82px;
}

.link-text {
  color:var(--gray-500);
  font-size:12px;
  line-height:1.4;
  word-break:break-all;
}

.link-type {
  display:inline-flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;
  min-height:24px;
  padding:0 8px;
  border-radius:999px;
  background:#f1f5f9;
  color:#475569;
  font-size:11px;
  font-weight:900;
  margin-top:4px;
}

.link-type.external {
  background:#fff7ed;
  color:#c2410c;
}

.link-type.dashboard {
  background:#ecfdf5;
  color:#047857;
}

.footer-note {
  margin-top:28px;
  color:#777;
  font-size:14px;
}

.member-col-no { width:6%; }
.member-col-hq { width:13%; }
.member-col-division { width:13%; }
.member-col-office { width:15%; }
.member-col-team { width:17%; }
.member-col-emp { width:12%; }
.member-col-name { width:12%; }
.member-col-leader { width:12%; }

.att-col-no { width:6%; }
.att-col-org { width:27%; }
.att-col-team { width:19%; }
.att-col-name { width:13%; }
.att-col-status { width:13%; }
.att-col-time { width:22%; }

.qr-col-name { width:22%; }
.qr-col-type { width:16%; }
.qr-col-count { width:8%; }
.qr-col-link { width:34%; }
.qr-col-qr { width:10%; }
.qr-col-action { width:10%; }

.dash-col-role { width:13%; }
.dash-col-name { width:25%; }
.dash-col-count { width:8%; }
.dash-col-link { width:34%; }
.dash-col-qr { width:10%; }
.dash-col-action { width:10%; }

@media (max-width:1100px) {
  .grid.two {
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
  }

  .hero {
    flex-direction:column;
  }

  .clock-card {
    width:100%;
    text-align:left;
  }

  .summary-grid {
    grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));
  }
}

@media (max-width:720px) {
  .app {
    padding:18px 12px 24px;
  }

  .hero {
    padding:22px 18px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size:27px;
  }

  .form-grid {
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
  }

  .summary-grid {
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
  }

  .section-header,
  .tool-row {
    align-items:stretch;
    flex-direction:column;
  }

  .search-box {
    max-width:none;
  }

  table {
    font-size:12px;
  }

  th {
    font-size:12px;
  }

  th,
  td {
    padding:5px 3px;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="app">
<header class="hero">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">EMERGENCY RESPONSE TRAINING</p>
    <h1>비상대응훈련 출결관리 시스템</h1>
    <p class="hero-desc">
      통합 출결, 협력·외주, 팀장 현황, 실장·사업부장·본부장 대시보드 링크를 자동 생성합니다.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="clock-card">
    <span>현재 한국시간</span>
    <strong id="kstClock">-</strong>
    <div id="firebaseState" class="connection-state warn">Firebase 연결 확인 중</div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="grid two">
  <section class="card">
    <div class="card-header">
      <div>
        <h2 class="card-title">새로운 훈련 만들기 / 수정</h2>
        <p class="card-subtitle">훈련명과 출석 가능 시간을 입력한 뒤 저장하세요.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card-body">
      <div class="form-grid">
        <div class="full">
          <label for="trainingName">훈련명</label>
          <input id="trainingName" placeholder="예: 시스템 개발용 테스트" />
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="startAt">출석 시작 시간 · 한국시간</label>
          <input id="startAt" type="datetime-local" />
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="endAt">출석 종료 시간 · 한국시간</label>
          <input id="endAt" type="datetime-local" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="button-row">
        <button onclick="startNewTraining()">새로운 훈련 만들기</button>
        <button class="primary" onclick="saveTraining()">훈련 저장</button>
      </div>

      <div id="trainingMessage" class="message"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <div class="card-header">
      <div>
        <h2 class="card-title">저장된 훈련 불러오기</h2>
        <p class="card-subtitle">훈련을 선택하면 명단, 링크, 출결현황이 연결됩니다.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card-body">
      <label for="trainingSelect">훈련 선택</label>
      <select id="trainingSelect" onchange="selectTrainingFromDropdown(this.value)">
        <option value="">저장된 훈련이 없습니다.</option>
      </select>

      <div style="margin-top:16px;">
        <div class="info-line">
          <span class="info-label">선택된 훈련</span>
          <span class="info-value" id="selectedTrainingName">-</span>
        </div>

        <div class="info-line">
          <span class="info-label">훈련 ID</span>
          <span class="info-value" id="selectedTrainingId">-</span>
        </div>

        <div class="info-line">
          <span class="info-label">출석 가능 시간</span>
          <span class="info-value" id="selectedTrainingPeriod">-</span>
        </div>

        <div class="info-line">
          <span class="info-label">상태</span>
          <span class="info-value">
            <span id="trainingStatusBadge" class="badge empty">미선택</span>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<div class="summary-grid">
  <div class="summary-card">
    <span>내부 대상</span>
    <strong id="totalCount">0</strong>
  </div>
  <div class="summary-card">
    <span>대피완료</span>
    <strong id="checkedCount">0</strong>
  </div>
  <div class="summary-card">
    <span>부재</span>
    <strong id="absenceCount">0</strong>
  </div>
  <div class="summary-card">
    <span>확인중</span>
    <strong id="checkingCount">0</strong>
  </div>
  <div class="summary-card">
    <span>협력·외주 출석</span>
    <strong id="externalCount">0</strong>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div>
      <div class="red-title">참석자 명단 복붙 입력</div>
      <p class="card-subtitle">엑셀의 순번 / 본부 / 사업부 / 실 / 팀 / 사번 / 성명 / 팀장여부 8개 열을 그대로 붙여넣으세요.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="button-row" style="margin-top:0;">
      <button onclick="addParticipantManually()">참석자 1명 추가</button>
      <button class="ghost-red" onclick="deleteAllInternalParticipants()">내부 참석자 전체 삭제</button>
      <button class="ghost-red" onclick="deleteAllExternalParticipants()">협력·외주 기록 삭제</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-body">
    <p class="hint">
      예시: 1 &nbsp; 연구개발본부 &nbsp; - &nbsp; R&amp;D기획실 &nbsp; R&amp;D안전인프라팀 &nbsp; 2022032 &nbsp; 이상훈 &nbsp; 해당
    </p>

    <textarea id="pasteBox" placeholder="엑셀에서 8개 열을 복사한 뒤 여기에 붙여넣으세요.&#10;순번&#9;본부&#9;사업부&#9;실&#9;팀&#9;사번&#9;성명&#9;팀장여부&#10;1&#9;연구개발본부&#9;-&#9;R&D기획실&#9;R&D안전인프라팀&#9;2022032&#9;이상훈&#9;해당"></textarea>

    <div class="button-row">
      <button class="primary" onclick="applyPastedParticipants()">참석자 명단 반영</button>
      <button onclick="clearPasteBox()">입력창 비우기</button>
    </div>

    <div id="memberMessage" class="message"></div>

    <div class="tool-row">
      <div>
        <strong>참석자 명단</strong>
        <span class="hint">대시보드 링크 생성을 위해 본부/사업부/실/팀 정보가 필요합니다.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="search-box">
        <input id="keyword" oninput="renderAll()" placeholder="본부, 사업부, 실, 팀, 사번, 성명 검색" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="table-wrap members">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th class="member-col-no">순번</th>
            <th class="member-col-hq">본부</th>
            <th class="member-col-division">사업부</th>
            <th class="member-col-office">실</th>
            <th class="member-col-team">팀</th>
            <th class="member-col-emp">사번</th>
            <th class="member-col-name">성명</th>
            <th class="member-col-leader">팀장여부</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody id="memberTbody">
          <tr>
            <td colspan="8" class="empty-row">훈련을 선택하거나 새 훈련을 저장해주세요.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <div>
      <h2 class="plain-title">참여자 / 팀장 현황 링크</h2>
      <p class="card-subtitle">
        통합 출결과 협력·외주는 훈련 ID 포함 링크, 팀장 현황은 팀명 기반 고정 링크로 생성됩니다.
      </p>
    </div>

    <button class="green" onclick="copyAllParticipantLinks()">전체 참여자/팀장 링크 복사</button>
  </div>

  <div class="section-body">
    <div class="table-wrap qr">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th class="qr-col-name">대상</th>
            <th class="qr-col-type">구분</th>
            <th class="qr-col-count">인원</th>
            <th class="qr-col-link">링크</th>
            <th class="qr-col-qr">QR</th>
            <th class="qr-col-action">복사</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody id="qrTbody">
          <tr>
            <td colspan="6" class="empty-row">훈련을 저장하면 링크가 생성됩니다.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-header">
